      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60e65f577ae9d0492b0f2a75|full_name} They would be hand inspected! This means no shenanigans. \n\n- No Ear **** sounds, even though the avatar is \"Good\". \n\n- No nudity, even though the avatar isn't marked NSFW. \n\n- Etc. Etc.\n\nAdditionally, the less I need to interact with these systems the better. I shouldn't have to manage other people's shit.\n\nI hate starting a conversation with someone, only to show their avatar and have that change the whole context, just as another anecdote.\n\nThis option wouldn't FIX these things. But it could make a dent!\n\nIt could also be another incentive for going through the marketplace. A perk.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
